  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Applying certain buffs to allies grants 300% Additional Base Grenade, Melee, and Class Ability Regeneration Rate for <pve 7 /> <pvp [3.5?] /> seconds.\n\nActivation Triggers:\n• Granting the <solar/>Cure, <solar/>Radiant, or <solar/>Restoration <solar/>Solar subclass buffs to allies\n• Healing (from most sources), or reviving allies\n\nWill NOT trigger <solar/>Ember of Benevolence:\nEmpowering Rifts, Mods, <exotic Crest of Alpha Lupi />'s Healing Pulse, Mothkeeper's Wraps Overshield Moth, Non-Solar Support Frame Auto Rifles",
      "updatedAt": "2025-08-23T20:48:03.253Z",
      "updatedBy": "Stardust"
    }
  },
